      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I see two options when it comes to dealing with the trolls. Either give people a much larger list of preset options and remove the custom option, or be much stricter on moderation of custom pronouns. \n\nBoth unfortunately open vrchat to criticism for essentially having to choose what pronouns are and aren't valid.\n\nAt the very least I would want to see a larger preset pool, options to mix and match, and an option to disable seeing custom pronouns.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
