      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{618fa6ccbfca2a69d13f829c|full_name} ask for pronouns is a great idea, it allows free expression while preventing abusive text. Ask for pronouns says a lot, it implies \"my pronouns aren't any of the known ones, and I would like others to be aware\" (compared to \"any\" or just not having a preference/not providing info) which is what the \"other\" option implies.",
